<h2 id="medical-review">Medical review</h2>
<p>Dr. Ravi Shankar Gupta, our Chief Medical Editor, reviews reviews and guides before they are published. This site gives information about software. It is not medical advice, and it does not replace your clinical judgement or your local regulator’s guidance.</p>

<h2 id="sources">Sources</h2>
<p>We rely on vendors’ own documentation, regulators’ public databases and our own testing. We label vendor claims as vendor claims and link our sources.</p>

<h2 id="independence">Independence</h2>
<p>Editorial decisions are made independently of advertisers and affiliate partners. See the <a href="/disclosure/">affiliate disclosure</a>.</p>

<h2 id="corrections">Corrections and updates</h2>
<p>If you find an error, <a href="/contact/">tell us</a>. We correct factual errors promptly and show the date a page was last updated.</p>

<h2 id="ai">Use of AI in our work</h2>
<p>We use AI tools to help research and draft. Every published page is checked by a person, and medical content is reviewed by our Chief Medical Editor.</p>
